{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "斜率 k 如何改变直线 y = kx",
    "goals": [
      "理解斜率 k 表示横坐标每增加 1 时纵坐标的变化量 Δy",
      "直观观察 k 为正、0、负时直线的倾斜方向与陡峭程度"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "采用逐步比较变化量的方法：固定横坐标增加 1，观察纵坐标的变化",
        "通过连续调节斜率数值滑块直观对比正负与水平状态"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "斜率 k",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.03
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "请拖动滑块，把斜率 k 调整为 3，观察直线的陡峭程度。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "沿着正方向继续向右移动滑块",
          "目标数值是正整数 3"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "做得很准确。当 k = 3 时，横坐标每增加 1，纵坐标增加 3，直线比之前更加陡峭了。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 3,
          "tolerance": 0.015
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "建立直觉并观察斜率 k 变化时直线 y=kx 的旋转与变化规律，完成课后练习",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你好，我是阿澜。我们来看正比例函数 y = kx。理解斜率最关键的理由，是看两个变化量的比值：横坐标增加 1 时，纵坐标究竟变了多少。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线 y = kx",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -6,
                    "max": 6,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(x)",
                    "label": "y = kx"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(0)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-03",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率的意义",
                "items": [
                  "x 每增加 1，y 改变 k",
                  "k > 0：向右上方倾斜",
                  "k = 0：水平直线",
                  "k < 0：向右下方倾斜"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "现在的斜率是 1，横坐标每往右走 1 个单位，纵坐标就往上走 1 个单位。我们把 k 调大到 2，你会发现每往右 1 格，纵向抬升了 2 格，直线明显变得更陡。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "如果把 k 调到 0，无论横坐标怎么增加，纵坐标的变化量始终是 0，直线变成了水平的 x 轴。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 0,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "再把 k 降到负数，比如 -1。横坐标增加 1 时，纵坐标反而减少 1，直线转向了右下方。现在轮到你了，请在课后练习中把滑块调到 3，观察更陡峭的上升直线。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": -1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "斜率 k 衡量了直线的倾斜方向与陡峭程度，它本质上是横坐标增加 1 时纵坐标对应的变化量 Δy。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
